"basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-904d090576b86d0524e6"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-904d090576b86d0524e6","source_order":[64,100,0],"order":11037},{"id":"santizhu064-e-o106a","title":"丁奉张布缚孙綝、孙休下令斩之并赦众","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-00cf3adf30cb71c190b0","label":"正文","text":"丁奉张布缚孙綝、孙休下令斩之并赦众；孙闿乘船欲北降，被追杀，夷三族","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e","santizhu064-q-4f6d686089ae2e7b50ce"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0150","role":"拒绝孙綝出屯请求并下令斩孙綝、赦其众","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0017","role":"与张布示意左右缚孙綝","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0035","role":"与丁奉示意左右缚孙綝","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e"]},{"person":"houzhu-p0013","role":"被缚并斩首","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0166","role":"乘船欲降魏后被追杀","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e","santizhu064-q-4f6d686089ae2e7b50ce"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e","source_order":[64,106,76],"related_events":[{"event":"santizhu-e-o042b","type":"related","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e","santizhu-q-54f2dc6f6203f3be065d"]}],"order":11044}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0166","name":"闿","evidence":["santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-54f2dc6f6203f3be065d","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-cced04774049129696f5","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，戊辰腊〖24〗，百僚朝贺，公卿升殿；诏武士缚綝","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":155,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-4f6d686089ae2e7b50ce","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-358efb901997640d5be3","layer":"original","quote":"闿乘船欲北降，追杀之。夷三族。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":516,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":202,"end":217,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-e9625f9b47fb4c167a95","layer":"original","quote":"綝以孙亮始亲政事，多所难问，甚惧。还建业，称疾不朝。筑室于朱雀桥南〖1〗，使弟威远将军据，入苍龙宿卫〖2〗；弟武卫将军恩、偏将军幹、长水校尉闿，分屯诸营：欲以专朝自固。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-8cc8349758b19c0e3cd6","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-1ed48f2a0752e4fd8d7e","layer":"original","quote":"幹，杂号将军〖19〗，亭侯。闿，亦封亭侯。”","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":483,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":157,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-904d090576b86d0524e6","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-1ed48f2a0752e4fd8d7e","layer":"original","quote":"休引见慰喻。又下诏曰：“朕以不德〖14〗，守藩于外。值兹际会，群公卿士，暨于朕躬，以奉宗庙。朕用怃然〖15〗，若涉渊冰〖16〗。大将军忠计内发，扶危定倾；安康社稷，功勋赫然。昔汉孝宣践阼〖17〗，霍光尊显；褒德赏功，古今之通义也。其以大将军为丞相，荆州牧，食五县〖18〗。恩为御史大夫，卫将军；据，右将军：皆县侯。幹，杂号将军〖19〗，亭侯。闿，亦封亭侯","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":483,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-ee98caa8b0362433375e","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-358efb901997640d5be3","layer":"original","quote":"綝求出，休曰：“外兵自多，不足烦丞相也！”綝起离席，奉、布目左右，缚之〖6〗。綝叩首曰：“愿徙交州！”休曰：“卿何以不徙滕胤、吕据！”綝复曰：“愿没为官奴！”休曰：“何不以胤、据为奴乎！”遂斩之。以綝首令其众曰：“诸与綝同谋皆赦！”放仗者五千人〖7〗。闿乘船欲北降，追杀之","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":516,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
